# 二进制素材必须原样签出：Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会把纯 ASCII 的 PDF 当成文本，
# 检出时把 LF 换成 CRLF，PDF 的交叉引用偏移就失效了。
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
